<h3>Before you read: watch this first</h3>
<p>The <em>Meditations</em> can feel disorienting on a first read because Descartes is doing something unusual: he is deliberately trying to break his own beliefs before rebuilding them. This video introduces the method of doubt and what Descartes is trying to accomplish before you encounter it in the text.</p>
