<p>Before you continue</p>
<p>Before you open the reading, take a moment: what do <em>you</em> think you know with absolute certainty? Write down two or three things. Then ask: could Descartes’ evil demon make any of them false? You’ll think about these differently once you have read Meditation I.</p>
</div></div>
