<p>For audio versions of the <em>Meditations</em>, visit <a href="https://www.earlymoderntexts.com/authors/descartes" target="_blank">earlymoderntexts.com/authors/descartes</a>. Audio files are available for each meditation individually.</p>
</div></div>
<div class="callout callout--note"><span class="callout__icon" aria-hidden="true">ℹ️</span><div class="callout__content">
<p>Reading tip</p>
<p>Each meditation builds on the previous one. If you find yourself lost in Meditation III, the problem is almost certainly in something you missed in Meditation II. It is worth backtracking. The lecture pages for each meditation will help you identify the key moves before and after you read.</p>
